                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Wandering past a restaurant that\u0027s easy to miss, this one impressed me with its perfectly chewy noodles, the scallops were fresh and flavorful, the tomato sauce was delicious, and a touch of basil added a wonderful aroma. It arrived piping hot and was absolutely delicious! The owner was friendly and straightforward. If it\u0027s crowded, be sure to ask her for directions; calling ahead to reserve will save you from waiting.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "走過容易錯過的餐坊，麵條硬度適中微勁令人印象深刻，干貝鮮香，茄汁夠味，加了一點九層塔提香，上來的時候超熱，非常好吃！老闆娘親切，講話實在，人多要問一下老闆娘，如果提早打電話預訂就比較不用等~",
